# Allow-list for every build with the repository root as context: nothing gets in unless it is
# named below. Keeps `.git`, `target/`, node_modules, local `.env` files and the like out of
# the build context (and out of image layers).
*

!web/
!docs/design/prototypes/
# The Cargo workspace, for the `app` image (docker/app/Dockerfile).
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/

# Never copy installed or built output from the host into an image.
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.tmp-*
